WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.910
Solomon's Jerusalem.

2
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:06.500
A Temple built in seven years,
and a palace in thirteen.

3
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.020
Silver as common as stones.

4
00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.020
Seven hundred wives.

5
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.910
Thirty thousand men sent
to cut cedar in Lebanon.

6
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:20.050
Later, in the northern kingdom, the
prophet Elijah stands before King Ahab.

7
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.240
The king greets him: Is that
you, you troubler of Israel?

8
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.710
So who held real power
in Israel: the king,

9
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.100
or the prophet?

10
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.160
In this mission, you'll see
how Solomon's state worked,

11
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.520
and why the kingdom split in two.

12
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:37.080
Then you'll follow Elijah to Mount Carmel,

13
00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:39.460
and to a vineyard that a king wanted.

14
00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.890
Your mission: find out who really
held power in Israel, and why.
